# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AL-JABR ROOT MANIFEST — Root-Pattern AI Logic v1.0
# "The Root is the Essence. The Pattern is the Function."
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# STRUCTURE:
#   Classical Arabic uses trilateral roots (3-letter stems)
#   that carry a "cloud" of meaning. Patterns (verb forms)
#   shape HOW that meaning is applied.
#
# FORMAT:  root | domain | essence | description
#
# DOMAINS:
#   aqua      — Aquaponics subsystem
#   flywheel  — Flywheel energy storage
#   silk      — Silk wiring / strand network
#   pressure  — AC Lobby pressure differential
#   system    — Cross-domain / meta operations
#
# PATTERNS (Verb Forms):
#   A  = Accelerate   — Increase / boost / amplify
#   I  = Isolate      — Protect / shield / contain
#   V  = Verify       — Check / validate / diagnose
#   M  = Monitor      — Observe / read / sense
#   R  = Restore      — Reset / heal / return to nominal
#   D  = Diminish     — Reduce / slow / cool
#   T  = Transmit     — Signal / send / broadcast
#
# GRAMMAR:
#   Bare root:    HFZ         — Full protection sequence (all patterns)
#   Root.Pattern: HFZ.I       — Specific pattern (Isolate only)
#   Chain:        HFZ>QDR     — Sequential execution
#   Branch:       HFZ|SLM     — Conditional OR
#   Multi-pat:    HFZ.IV      — Multiple patterns (Isolate + Verify)
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── AQUAPONICS ROOTS ───────────────────────────────────────

HYA | aqua | life/vitality | Plankton life force — the living essence of the system
GDH | aqua | nourishment | Nutrient flow — feeding and pH balance
DFQ | aqua | flow/current | Water pump cycle — circulation and movement

# ─── FLYWHEEL ROOTS ─────────────────────────────────────────

QDR | flywheel | power/capacity | Flywheel energy — RPM, torque, kinetic reserve
HRR | flywheel | heat/thermal | Thermal regulation — temperature and friction

# ─── SILK ROOTS ─────────────────────────────────────────────

WSL | silk | connection/bond | Silk strand integrity — wiring, links, resistance
NZM | silk | order/pattern | Strand network order — calibration and harmony

# ─── PRESSURE ROOTS ─────────────────────────────────────────

HFZ | pressure | preservation | Air Curtain protection — seal, shield, contain
DGT | pressure | pressure/force | Pressure differential — nitrogen, internal/external
NFD | pressure | exhale/release | Vent and depressurize — nitrogen release

# ─── ECONOMY ROOTS ─────────────────────────────────────────

QSB | economy | acquisition/wealth | Machine Wallet — earning, spending, and auditing compute credits

# ─── SYSTEM ROOTS ───────────────────────────────────────────

SLM | system | safety/peace | Pre-Completion Checklist — full system verification
